      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The span explicitly identifies supplier mix as a possible influence on attachment rates."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C035.signal_basis",
    "value": "Missing-attachment frequency decreases after attachment responsibility becomes explicit, with comparable orders and consistent inspection intervals. Other workflow conditions are held unchanged where feasible and concurrent changes logged, but temporal association cannot exclude alternative causes, including supplier mix.",
    "scope": "The prospective comparison supports retaining supplier mix as a possible alternative explanation; it does not demonstrate an effect of supplier mix.",
